      "align": "left",
      "indent_first": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Operating margin improved to 18.2% from 15.6%, reflecting both operating leverage and a one-time reduction in cloud infrastructure costs following the migration completed in August.",
